& \mathrm{BD}=\sqrt{(4+1)^{2}+(7+2)^{2}+(6+1)^{2}}=\sqrt{25+81+49}=\sqrt{155}
\end{aligned}\]

Since \(\mathrm{AC} \neq \mathrm{BD}, \mathrm{ABCD}\) is not a rectangle.
> - Note We can also show that ABCD is a parallelogram, using the property that diagonals AC and BD bisect each other.

